--- !u!114 &487907600
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 487907597}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 27be81e0366253c4895cad81c977e3af, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LocalizedText
  portuguese: "Voc\xEA virou pai solteiro h\xE1 pouco tempo e, desde ent\xE3o, n\xE3o sabe como tocar a vida daqui para frente.\n\nDepois de acumular engradados de cerveja vazios e caixas de pizza na sala, e de ouvir centenas de vezes \"Black\", do Pearl Jam, pensando na sua amada, voc\xEA decide dar um jeito: tirar a poeira da sala, a gordura de dedo dos controles e, acima de tudo, enfrentar a selva que deixou crescer no quintal.\n\nAl\xE9m de refletir o seu estado atual, aquele matagal esconde algo mais sobrenatural do que voc\xEA imaginava."
  english: 'You became a single dad not long ago and, ever since, you have no idea how to move your life forward.


    After piling up empty beer crates and pizza boxes in the living room, and listening to "Black" by Pearl Jam hundreds of times while thinking about your beloved, you decide to get your life in order: dust off the living room, scrub the finger grease off the controllers and, above all, face the jungle you let grow in the backyard.


    Besides mirroring your current state, that thicket hides something more supernatural than you imagined.'
--- !u!114 &487907601
